{"id":1700870,"shortDescription":"Clanfolk, un simulador medieval de colonias en las Tierras Altas escocesas. Caza, pesca, cultiva; usa el entorno para sobrevivir al duro invierno. Haz una posada, comercia con otros clanes, haz crecer tu familia mediante bodas e hijos: vive y prospera a lo largo de generaciones.","developers":["MinMax Games Ltd."],"publishers":["Hooded Horse"],"categories":["Un jugador","Tamaño del texto ajustable","Controles de volumen personalizados","Dificultad ajustable","Guardar en cualquier momento","Sonido estéreo","Steam Cloud","Préstamo familiar"],"releaseDateRaw":"14 JUL 2022","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1700870/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1795189363","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1700870/2d152e08224f5861c86c04a9f370e02d98d36da0/ss_2d152e08224f5861c86c04a9f370e02d98d36da0.600x338.jpg?t=1795189363","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1700870/2d152e08224f5861c86c04a9f370e02d98d36da0/ss_2d152e08224f5861c86c04a9f370e02d98d36da0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1795189363"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1700870/e33bd856852723a9f4074f7c140ee6603ce26659/ss_e33bd856852723a9f4074f7c140ee6603ce26659.600x338.jpg?t=1795189363","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1700870/e33bd856852723a9f4074f7c140ee6603ce26659/ss_e33bd856852723a9f4074f7c140ee6603ce26659.1920x1080.jpg?t=1795189363"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1700870/246cbc2b67054b5049646736ab922baae1606bf5/ss_246cbc2b67054b5049646736ab922baae1606bf5.600x338.jpg?t=1795189363","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1700870/246cbc2b67054b5049646736ab922baae1606bf5/ss_246cbc2b67054b5049646736ab922baae1606bf5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1795189363"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps